This is a MODIFIED version of the original "rtk" work, maintained by
Harshit Singh Bhandari. Files that carry changes are marked as modified
through this NOTICE. Significant changes made in this fork include:

  * Renamed the user-facing CLI command and binary from `rtk` to `stc`
    (the internal Rust crate, data directory, RTK_* environment variables,
    and `[rtk]` log prefix are retained for compatibility).
  * Added transparent OpenAI Codex CLI auto-rewrite via a PreToolUse hook.
  * Replaced the upstream release pipeline with a fork-owned pipeline that
    cuts GitHub releases on harshitsinghbhandari/stc and publishes a Homebrew
    formula (`stc`) to the harshitsinghbhandari/homebrew-tap tap.
